              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin^{2} (\\frac{\\pi}{4}+x)=\\sin^{2} (\\frac{\\pi}{4}-x)+\\sqrt{7}\\cos x\"></span>. </li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-e;\\pi]\"></span> .</li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:28:28.743951+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б) <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{2}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:28:28.743951+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\"><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"cd1fb861-525f-4354-b877-b1d88caee646\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>Ис­поль­зу­ем фор­му­лу раз­но­сти квад­ра­тов, затем фор­му­лы суммы и раз­но­сти си­ну­сов:<center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin^{2} (\\frac{\\pi}{4}+x)=\\sin^{2} (\\frac{\\pi}{4}-x)+\\sqrt{7}\\cos x\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\sin^{2} (\\frac{\\pi}{4}+x)-\\sin^{2} (\\frac{\\pi}{4}-x)=\\sqrt{7}\\cos x\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff (\\sin (\\frac{\\pi}{4}+x)-\\sin (\\frac{\\pi}{4}-x))(\\sin (\\frac{\\pi}{4}+x)+\\sin (\\frac{\\pi}{4}-x))=\\sqrt{7}\\cos x\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff 2\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\sin x\\cdot 2\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\cos x=\\sqrt{7}\\cos x\\iff \\cos x(2\\sin x-\\sqrt{7})=0\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x=0\\\\\\sin x=\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{2}\\gt 1\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Отберём корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти. По­лу­чим <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{2}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
